    text: "Affected stops:\r\nW 32nd Ave & Stuart St (#10913) (eastbound)\r\nW 32nd Ave & Osceola St (#10903) (eastbound)\r\nW 32nd Ave & Meade St (#10897) (eastbound)\r\nW 32nd Ave & Meade St (#10898) (westbound)\r\nW 32nd Ave & Perry St (#10904) (westbound)\r\nW 32nd Ave & Stuart St (#10914) (westbound)\r\n\nFor eastbound Route 32 get on/off buses at:\r\nW 32nd Ave & Vrain St (#10921)\r\nW 32nd Ave & Julian St (#10891)\r\n\nFor westbound Route 32 get on/off buses at:\r\nW 32nd Ave & Julian St (#10892)\r\nW 32nd Ave & Vrain St (#10922)"
